# EXAMPLE crew script: bring up four GPCs and two CRTs through the NBAT to
# OPS 2, waiting on the O6 MODE talkbacks rather than fixed times.  One file
# holds the switches and the keystrokes; panelO6.py plays it (crewscript.py).
# Run from discretePanel/:
#
#   python3 simulatePASS.py --gpcs 1-4 --crts 2 --tape OI340700-v44boot.mmv \
#       --script examples/4gpc-startup.script --duration 900
#
# Every time is written +N: N seconds after the line before (or after the
# wait above it), so a line can be inserted without renumbering the rest.
# Nothing here is a guessed delay: each IPL waits for the GPCIPL menu's title
# to appear on the CRT, and each load for that GPC's MODE talkback to read RUN.
#
# Verified 2026-09-15 with these waits: four GPCs to OPS 2, no CAM lamp, MM1
# 239 commands / 2045 blocks read (the same as every earlier verified run).
# Each GPCIPL menu appeared 13.5 s after its STANDBY and each load took 25-28.5
# s, so OPS 2 was typed about 363 s after the panel started -- against 570 s
# when only the talkbacks were waited on, and 840 s with fixed times throughout.

# --- all four GPCs to HALT, the IDPs on, GPC1 IPL from MM1 on CRT 1 ---------
+0     gpc 1
+0     mode HALT
+0.01  gpc 2
+0.01  mode HALT
+0.01  gpc 3
+0.01  mode HALT
+0.01  gpc 4
+0.01  mode HALT
+0.02  idppower 1 on
+0.01  idppower 2 on
+0.01  crt 1
+0.1   source MM1
+0.2   gpc 1
+0.1   ipl
+2.5   mode STANDBY
wait crt 1 title GPCIPL timeout 150
+2     keys ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC1 loaded: to RUN; GPC2 IPL on CRT 2 ----------------------------------
wait gpc 1 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
+1     crt 0
+2     mode RUN
+2     source OFF
+5     gpc 2
+1     source MM1
+1     crt 2
+0.5   idpload 2
+0.5   ipl
+3     mode STANDBY
wait crt 2 title GPCIPL timeout 150
+2     keys KB2 ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC2 loaded: to RUN; GPC3 IPL -------------------------------------------
wait gpc 2 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
+1     crt 0
+2     mode RUN
+2     source OFF
+5     gpc 3
+1     source MM1
+1     crt 2
+0.5   idpload 2
+0.5   ipl
+3     mode STANDBY
wait crt 2 title GPCIPL timeout 150
+2     keys KB2 ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC3 loaded: to RUN; GPC4 IPL -------------------------------------------
wait gpc 3 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
+1     crt 0
+2     mode RUN
+2     source OFF
+5     gpc 4
+1     source MM1
+1     crt 2
+0.5   idpload 2
+0.5   ipl
+3     mode STANDBY
wait crt 2 title GPCIPL timeout 150
+2     keys KB2 ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC4 loaded: to RUN; the NBAT, then OPS 2 -------------------------------
wait gpc 4 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
+1     crt 0
+2     mode RUN
+2     source OFF
+11    keys ITEM 1 + 2 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 2 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 3 + 2 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 4 + 3 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 5 + 4 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 7 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 8 + 2 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 9 + 3 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 0 + 4 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 1 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 2 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 3 + 2 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 8 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 9 + 2 EXEC
+21    keys OPS 2 0 1 PRO
